{"id": "u16", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "rom_pa", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 42, "out_tokens": 977, "cost_inr": 0.386322, "latency_ms": 7757.3, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 42, "out_tokens": 977, "reasoning_tokens": 854, "cost_inr": 0.386322, "latency_s": 7.757}], "reasoning_tokens": 854, "answer": "**Translation:** \"Why has my account been closed? I deposit money every month.\"\n\nA few notes:\n- The message is in colloquial Hindi/Punjabi (Roman script).\n- The word \"ta\" adds emphasis, so it could also be rendered as \"But I *do* deposit money every month.\"\n- \"Paunda si\" is technically past habitual (\"used to deposit\"), so an alternative translation is: \"My account has been closed — why? I used to deposit money every month.\"\n\nThe customer is essentially disputing the closure of their account, pointing out their regular deposits as justification.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u17", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "pa", "difficulty": "easy", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 28, "out_tokens": 1206, "cost_inr": 0.473868, "latency_ms": 7958.0, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 28, "out_tokens": 1206, "reasoning_tokens": 1001, "cost_inr": 0.473868, "latency_s": 7.958}], "reasoning_tokens": 1001, "answer": "**ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਲੋਨ ਦੀ EMI 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਨੂੰ ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ ਕਰਨੀ ਹੈ।**\n\n*Transliteration:* Tuhaḍe loan dī EMI 5 Dusambar nū jamhā karanī hai.\n\nNote: \"EMI\" is commonly used as-is in Punjabi banking contexts. Alternatively, you could say **ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਲੋਨ ਦੀ EMI 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਨੂੰ ਡਿਊ ਹੈ** (using the borrowed word \"due\").", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u18", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "hi", "difficulty": "easy", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 41, "out_tokens": 402, "cost_inr": 0.161946, "latency_ms": 4117.2, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 41, "out_tokens": 402, "reasoning_tokens": 367, "cost_inr": 0.161946, "latency_s": 4.117}], "reasoning_tokens": 367, "answer": "Aapka credit card ka bill samay par jama nahi hua hai, isliye ab late fee (der ka jurmana) lagegi.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u19", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 66, "out_tokens": 282, "cost_inr": 0.118296, "latency_ms": 2775.8, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 66, "out_tokens": 282, "reasoning_tokens": 168, "cost_inr": 0.118296, "latency_s": 2.776}], "reasoning_tokens": 168, "answer": "**Option B, Rs 1,000 more.**\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSimple Interest = (P × R × T) / 100\n\n- **Option A:** (2,00,000 × 6.5 × 1) / 100 = **Rs 13,000**\n- **Option B:** (2,00,000 × 7 × 1) / 100 = **Rs 14,000**\n\nDifference: Rs 14,000 − Rs 13,000 = **Rs 1,000**", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u20", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "hi", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 124, "out_tokens": 258, "cost_inr": 0.116244, "latency_ms": 2636.8, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 124, "out_tokens": 258, "reasoning_tokens": 140, "cost_inr": 0.116244, "latency_s": 2.637}], "reasoning_tokens": 140, "answer": "लोन A, ₹1500 सस्ता।\n\n**गणना:**\n- लोन A का ब्याज: 1,00,000 × 9% × 1 = ₹9,000\n- लोन B का ब्याज: 1,00,000 × 10.5% × 1 = ₹10,500\n- अंतर: ₹10,500 − ₹9,000 = **₹1,500**", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u21", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 764, "cost_inr": 0.305394, "latency_ms": 4742.9, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 764, "reasoning_tokens": 406, "cost_inr": 0.305394, "latency_s": 4.743}], "reasoning_tokens": 406, "answer": "# Comparing the Two Options\n\n**Option A: 7% Simple Interest**\n\n$$SI = \\frac{P \\times r \\times t}{100} = \\frac{1{,}00{,}000 \\times 7 \\times 2}{100} = \\text{Rs } 14{,}000$$\n\n**Option B: 6.8% Compound Interest (yearly)**\n\n$$A = P\\left(1 + \\frac{r}{100}\\right)^2 = 1{,}00{,}000 \\times (1.068)^2$$\n\n$$A = 1{,}00{,}000 \\times 1.140624 = \\text{Rs } 1{,}14{,}062.40$$\n\n$$CI = 1{,}14{,}062.40 - 1{,}00{,}000 = \\text{Rs } 14{,}062.40$$\n\n*(Check: Year 1 interest = Rs 6,800; Year 2 interest = 6.8% of Rs 1,06,800 = Rs 7,262.40; Total = Rs 14,062.40 ✓)*\n\n# Conclusion\n\n| Option | Interest |\n|--------|----------|\n| A (Simple) | Rs 14,000 |\n| B (Compound) | Rs 14,062.40 |\n\n**Option B gives more interest**, by:\n\n$$14{,}062.40 - 14{,}000 = \\text{Rs } 62.40 \\approx \\boxed{\\text{Rs } 62}$$", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u22", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "pa", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 155, "out_tokens": 4000, "cost_inr": 1.57953, "latency_ms": 21501.2, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 155, "out_tokens": 4000, "reasoning_tokens": 3826, "cost_inr": 1.57953, "latency_s": 21.501}], "reasoning_tokens": 3826, "answer": "# EMI ਗਣਨਾ\n\n**ਫਾਰਮੂਲਾ:**\n\nEMI = [P × r × (1+r)ⁿ] / [(1+r)ⁿ − 1]\n\n**ਮੁੱਲ:**\n- ਮੁੱਢਲਾ ਕਰਜ਼ਾ (P) = ₹2,00,000\n- ਮਹੀਨਾਵਾਰ ਵਿਆਜ ਦਰ (r) = 11% ÷ 12 = 0.009167\n- ਮਹੀਨਿਆਂ ਦ", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
